# Project Overview

Personal portfolio (blakebauman.dev) built with React Router v7 and Cloudflare Workers. AI chatbot answers resume questions using Workers AI + Vectorize.

## Commands

```bash
pnpm run dev          # Dev server (http://localhost:5173)
pnpm run build        # Production build
pnpm run deploy       # Build and deploy
pnpm run typecheck    # Generate types + TypeScript check
```

Vectorize: `pnpm run vectorize:dev`, `vectorize:deploy`, `vectorize:populate`

## Key Paths

- `workers/app.ts` - Worker entry, routing, API endpoints
- `app/chat/request.ts` - AI request handling
- `app/types.ts` - Env, ResumeData, ChunkMetadata types
- `app/schemas/` - Zod v4 schemas and validation (chat, resume, errors)
- `app/routes.ts` - Route config

## Conventions

- Use types from `app/types.ts`: `Env`, `ResumeData`, `ChunkMetadata`
- Use Zod schemas from `app/schemas` for validation; prefer `safeParse` + `createValidationErrorResponse`
- Secrets via `wrangler secret put`, never in config
- Compatibility: `compatibility_date = "2025-02-11"`, `compatibility_flags = ["nodejs_compat"]`
